{
  "id": "16s",
  "name": "16S rRNA Amplicon Sequencing",
  "nameZH": "16S rRNA 扩增子测序",
  "category": "microbiome.amplicon",
  "tags": [
    "16S",
    "扩增子",
    "QIIME2",
    "DADA2"
  ],
  "overview": "16S rRNA 基因扩增子测序标准分析流程，从原始读段到 ASV 表、物种注释和多样性分析。",
  "icon": "bacteria",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "qiime2",
      "name": "QIIME 2 + DADA2",
      "type": "official",
      "url": "https://docs.qiime2.org/",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "import",
          "name": "数据导入",
          "description": "导入 FASTQ 并可视化质量",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "QIIME 2 tools import",
              "version": "2024.5",
              "params": "--type SampleData[PairedEndSequencesWithQuality]",
              "docker": "quay.io/qiime2/core:2024.5"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "需要准备 manifest 文件指定每个样本的 FASTQ 路径。先用 qiime demux summarize 查看测序质量。",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "denoise",
          "name": "去噪 + ASV 推断",
          "description": "DADA2 去噪生成 ASV 表",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "QIIME 2 dada2 denoise-paired",
              "version": "2024.5",
              "params": "--p-trunc-len-f 240 --p-trunc-len-r 200",
              "docker": "quay.io/qiime2/core:2024.5"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "DADA2 产生 ASV（Amplicon Sequence Variant），分辨率高于传统 OTU。trunc-len 需根据质量曲线选择（通常在质量骤降处截断）。",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 120
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "taxonomy",
          "name": "物种注释",
          "description": "训练分类器 + 物种分配",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "QIIME 2 feature-classifier",
              "version": "2024.5",
              "params": "--p-classifier silva-138-99-classifier.qza",
              "docker": "quay.io/qiime2/core:2024.5"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "推荐使用 SILVA 138 或 Greengenes2 数据库。先提取引物区段训练分类器以提高精度。生成物种丰度柱状图和热图。",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 240
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "phylogeny",
          "name": "系统发育树构建",
          "description": "多序列比对 + 系统发育推断",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "QIIME 2 phylogeny",
              "version": "2024.5",
              "params": "align-to-tree-mafft-fasttree",
              "docker": "quay.io/qiime2/core:2024.5"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "构建 ASV 的系统发育树，用于 UniFrac 距离计算。MAFFT 比对 + FastTree 建树是默认方案。",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 360
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "diversity",
          "name": "多样性分析",
          "description": "Alpha + Beta 多样性",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "QIIME 2 diversity core-metrics-phylogenetic",
              "version": "2024.5",
              "params": "--p-sampling-depth 10000",
              "docker": "quay.io/qiime2/core:2024.5"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "Alpha 多样性（Shannon、Faith PD、Observed features）；Beta 多样性（Weighted/Unweighted UniFrac、Bray-Curtis）。PCoA 可视化组间差异。",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 480
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "diff",
          "name": "差异分析",
          "description": "差异丰度分析",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "ANCOM-BC / LEfSe",
              "version": "2024.5 / 1.0",
              "params": "",
              "docker": "quay.io/qiime2/core:2024.5"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "ANCOM-BC 是 QIIME2 推荐的差异丰度分析方法，考虑了组成数据的特性。LEfSe 是经典方法，适合寻找生物标志物。",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 600
          }
        }
      ],
      "references": [
        {
          "title": "QIIME 2 Documentation",
          "url": "https://docs.qiime2.org/2024.5/",
          "type": "official"
        },
        {
          "title": "DADA2 (Callahan et al., 2016)",
          "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/nmeth.3869",
          "type": "paper"
        },
        {
          "title": "ANCOM-BC (Lin & Peddada, 2020)",
          "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-17041-7",
          "type": "paper"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "overviewEn": "16S rRNA amplicon sequencing analysis pipeline. Covers DADA2/ASV inference, taxonomic classification (SILVA/GreenGenes), diversity analysis, and differential abundance testing. Suitable for microbial community profiling."
}